# Cline Rules for OwenMinerCS

## Project Context

This is a static personal website (HTML/CSS/JS) for Owen Miner / OwenMinerCS.

**Always read first:**
1. `AGENTS.md` - canonical project entry point
2. `memory/preferences.md` - durable UI/site preferences
3. `memory/issues.md` - active bugs and unresolved issues

## Coding Standards

- **Static-first**: Prefer hand-written HTML/CSS/JS. Add JavaScript only when needed.
- **Small edits**: Make scoped changes that match the existing page style.
- **Reuse**: Use existing CSS classes and components before adding new styles.
- **Relative links**: Pages in subfolders need `../` for shared assets.
- **Conservative CSS**: Many pages share `css/owenminercs.css` - keep global changes minimal.

## File Structure

- `index.html` - home page
- `css/owenminercs.css` - shared global stylesheet
- `scripts/components.js` - shared custom elements (header/footer/dock)
- `shared/` - reusable header/head snippets
- `memory/` - durable project state and preferences

## Important Areas

- `Keyboard/` - Wooting 60HE build page
- `PC/`, `The Setup/` - PC and desk setup pages
- `Gaming/`, `Counter-Strike/` - CS2 content
- `Garage Sale/` - resale/shop pages
- `Socials/` - social feed and content
- `Donators/` - supporter features

## Preservation Rules

- **Do not modify**: Affiliate/support/legal disclosure copy unless explicitly requested
- **Do not guess**: Real affiliate IDs or private account details
- **Check git**: Run `git status --short` before and after substantial edits
- **Treat worktree as user-owned**: Many files may already be modified

## Accessibility

- Maintain meaningful alt text for images
- Keep link text visible and descriptive
- Ensure keyboard-friendly controls
- Run media accessibility check before publishing:

```powershell
node .\dev\media-accessibility-check.mjs
```

## Publishing

Use the manual review wrapper:

```powershell
.\dev\publish-with-media-check.ps1 -PublishCommand "netlify deploy --prod"
```

## AI Model Usage

This project uses local Ollama models when possible. Configure Cline:
- API Provider: OpenAI Compatible
- Base URL: `http://localhost:11434/v1`
- Model: Your installed Ollama model (e.g., `qwen3-coder:30b`)
